01291936789025", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12331303_245598725994458_479181173273133056_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TWOWI5x8khoQ7kNvwE8CCK2&_nc_oc=AdoG1LcREI-uVSV7RYzIU_4jD1W1MutEHbNtxy7weR63CUby4kfHr2-OqGmMDXzFz9k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFTwl9_oSACTVNon2Cdu6XuZVw-0tsicYhI2bFl3DMsAg&oe=6A86E83D"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "642658059801509", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12139433_425044671239926_4609888145117282304_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gbv0SOZ5w74Q7kNvwFOZF-Z&_nc_oc=AdpJGQwrHUwnDwrPxJhi1KRdeCeZB4uWqDvbHum0dKy96glC4aFjKSIUktRBPD5apfo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEf3WUbGRya0gZ-IJJsm5uvZuvc1AVzHN1WZ4PRiMjqGA&oe=6A86CE7B"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "619740281913536", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12139467_430682997415049_6349888944162734080_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GPgZvzko8u8Q7kNvwEa8qXn&_nc_oc=Adp_n3bSU2O_Y-IjkJYZ-N9Obs6Radv6j41nZlxPqlGQMMcS7EdU_4prStBn7D8rzUQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFNi5pRKCmpZD3qvByoqVsH6i7_bJOFUeCuqZXdaVwAfA&oe=6A86E3A5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "RotatorX", "keywords": ["Arcade", "Endlessrunner", "SciFi", "Speed", "Fast"], "long_description": "RotatorX is an endless runner type arcade game with a dark unique sci-fi atmosphere. Fast paced and addictive - but also meditative. The intuitive controls makes it easy to play - but it's hard to gain. Speed, procedural level design, dynamic lighting FX and an adaptive soundtrack will guarantee a challenging and immersive VR experience.\n\nKEY FEATURES\n* Dynamic lighting FX\n* Adaptive soundtrack\n* Intuitve controls\n* Procedural level design\n\n! Oculus Go only !", "short_description": "RotatorX is an endless runner type arcade game with a